{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2019-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1552003200, "end_date": 1552694399, "month_true_total": 68, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:15:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "49571934", "author": {"steamid": "76561198277521989", "personaname": "trmhnhut", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tranminhnhut240203/", "num_games_owned": 65, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3261, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 718, "last_played": 1761747867, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "The best game I have played so far !!! The game play, character, music is a masterpieces ! Very very recommended for who searching for Indie/Rogue like game!!! A must play game for me !!!!", "timestamp_created": 1552648067, "timestamp_updated": 1552648067, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49568243", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121930031", "personaname": "weakpettythief", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/weakpettythief/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2099, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1651, "last_played": 1513543397, "avatar": "958c6f01b8b3bb078d83b2e2645ec2975abf7480"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain is one of the single most fully realized of the massive onslaught of titles in the ever-expanding rouge-lite genres due to how tight the whole experience is. There are enough item drops that it's possible you've beat the game several times before trying everything, but not so many that you have to wonder if you will ever see certain drops at all. The journey the game wants you to take is only through about four worlds, each one with beautiful and quietly epic music--befitting of the art style--and feeling like a colossal undertaking after finally conquering the last, but, thanks to the games great cast of unique characters, it gives you a great opportunity to truly feel your progression as things become easier and easier to handle. Plus, there are secrets to be had that can make these quests more interesting if you please, resulting in either better drops, harder areas, or both (as is required for the last of these relics--a truly difficult feat indeed)!", "timestamp_created": 1552623239, "timestamp_updated": 1552623239, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49566323", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054347112", "personaname": "Charles Le Sorcier", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cyavel/", "num_games_owned": 419, "num_reviews": 78, "playtime_forever": 2970, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2940, "last_played": 1599986475, "avatar": "8893a5e36581f77acf44e395db5a52dabac1023f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is very challenging and can be frustrating at times but with a group of friends it's a blast.\nEverything about this game is simple to understand and not even much of a challenge to master but learning how to deal with enemies and the environment is the real challenge and the real fun. \n\n9/10 play with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1552610642, "timestamp_updated": 1552610642, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49553292", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006934200", "personaname": "Nick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006934200/", "num_games_owned": 704, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 7, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1552593228, "avatar": "950f9f3147d4c8530a5072825d01c34ee3f1afa1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Resolution scaling is broken, I have a 4k monitor and can't see ♥♥♥♥.\nHosting an online coop game is also super complicated.", "timestamp_created": 1552593307, "timestamp_updated": 1552593307, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.411663830280303955", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49540858", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007711315", "personaname": "Confu510n♥", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Confu510n/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1301, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1156, "last_played": 1530155808, "avatar": "789971968434f05d089b1625bbab48db4b043253"}, "language": "english", "review": "9/10\nAn amazing rouge-like, and one of the few I legitimately enjoyed and came back to many times over, especially more of an experience with friends", "timestamp_created": 1552524238, "timestamp_updated": 1552524238, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502762436866760254", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "p